OL,4,CHague adviser quits over rumours
OL,5, William Hague's special adviser has
OL,6, resigned over "untrue and malicious"
OL,7, allegations made against him, the
OL,8, Foreign Secretary has said.
OL,10,FMr Hague said suggestions Christopher
OL,11,FMyers' appointment was due to an
OL,12,Fimproper relationship between them were
OL,13,F"utterly false".
OL,15,FIn a statement, he also denied his
OL,16,Fmarriage to wife Ffion was in trouble.
OL,18,FHe revealed they have suffered multiple
OL,19,Fmiscarriages and are still grieving the
OL,20,Floss of a pregnancy this summer.
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
