OL,4,CObama condemns W Bank 'slaughter'
OL,5, US President Barack Obama has condemned
OL,6, the "senseless slaughter" of four
OL,7, Israeli settlers, as a new round of
OL,8, Mid-East diplomacy opens in Washington.
OL,10,FMr Obama spoke after talks with Israeli
OL,11,FPM Benjamin Netanyahu, on the eve of
OL,12,Fthe first direct talks between Israeli
OL,13,Fand Palestinian leaders in 20 months.
OL,15,FHe will meet Palestinian leader Mahmoud
OL,16,FAbbas later on Wednesday.
OL,18,FMr Netanyahu said Tuesday's killings
OL,19,Fnear Hebron were commited by people who
OL,20,F"butcher everything they oppose".
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
