OL,4,CFerrari recalls cars after fires
OL,5, Ferrari has decided to recall all of
OL,6, the 458 Italia cars it made this year,
OL,7, following reports of a number of the
OL,8, luxury cars catching fire.
OL,10,FFerrari said its engineers had flown
OL,11,Faround the world to investigate five
OL,12,Freports of "thermal incidents".
OL,14,FAs a result, it will be asking the
OL,15,Fowners of more than 1,200 of the
OL,16,Fsupercars to bring them in for
OL,17,Fmodification work.
OL,19,FThe 458 Italia typically costs about
OL,20,F#170,000 ($260,000).
OL,22,D]C This Ceefax page is from 01-09-10
OL,23,S]D Much more at: teletextarchive.com
